      "room": "FIN02",
      "flag": "ANCHORS_STABLE",
      "goal_clues": "Three local stabilizers in FIN01 accessible from walk; warning: keep release path open before powering transit.",
      "solution": "Activate three stabilizers (any order), open release line, then receiver at FIN02.",
      "result": "Stable approach, boss access; missing stabilizer shows numbered indicator. Physical final gate remains broken."
